      "post": {
        "summary": "In case the preferred uplink interface is down, device auto-selects a non-preferred\n       interface for uplink. Once the preferred uplink interface is brought up, this RPC\n       can be used to force the device to check cloud connectivity via preferred uplink\n       interface and select it for uplink",
